to our application

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.300
in the spring music space.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:05.440
This is going to
take a little bit,

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:07.600
so I'm going to pause the
video, and I'll come back to you

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:08.410
