00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.250
All right, the service
has been created.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.500
And if you look up
here in the console,

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:14.320
you can see here in Google Cloud
where we actually have created

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:16.030
