00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:18.220
So now the next step is
to go ahead and bind that

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.310
into our application.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.180
So let's do that right now.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:22.990
So we'll clear the
screen, and then

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:26.770
we'll do a Kf bind service
here, and what we'll do

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.990
is we'll bind the spring
music app to the Redis

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:32.890
