that'll take just a second.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.500
And then when that's done--
which it's done now--

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.910
we're going to go
ahead and we're

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:38.570
going to restart
our application.

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:41.470
So we'll do a Kf
restart spring music.

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:44.045
That will allow that new
binding to take effect.

00:05:44.045 --> 00:05:46.420
So we give that a second, and
then what we're going to do

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:48.970
is let's head back
into the web browser,

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:51.040
