we're using the new Cloud-based

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.470
Redis data store.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.553
All right, let's move back
into the Cloud Console.

00:06:07.553 --> 00:06:09.553
And I want to show you
