00:06:09.553 --> 00:06:10.580
before we wrap up.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:12.490
So the first is
Kf bindings, just

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:14.358
so you can see the
service bindings here,

00:06:14.358 --> 00:06:16.900
